---
# collection/<作品名>/<作品名>.md の全作品を1つの JSON にまとめる（GitHub Pages がビルド時に作る．作品一覧ページに使う）．消さないでください．
layout: null
---
{% assign keys = "タイトル,日付,説明" | split: "," %}[{% assign sep = "" %}{% for p in site.pages %}{% assign head = p.path | slice: 0, 11 %}{% assign ext = p.name | split: "." | last %}{% if head == "collection/" and ext == "md" %}{{ sep }}
{"file": {{ p.path | jsonify }}, "url": {{ p.url | jsonify }}, "data": { {% for k in keys %}{{ k | jsonify }}: {{ p[k] | jsonify }}{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %} }}{% assign sep = "," %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
]
